      "created_at": "2016-10-12T13:04:39.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Updates are still going to regularly be monthly, unless there's something specific to say. Like, I won't wait three weeks to tell you that the games have left China or anything like that. But unless something momentous happens (we get a sample to show off, the games are on the boat, we're shipping, the games were accidentally filled with scorpions), it'll be the regularly-scheduled updates.</p>",
